                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Massachusetts received nearly 6,000 grants amounting to $3.5 billion for life-saving medical research last year. \n\nThat's not just a line item you can cross out, lives are at stake. Shameful for the Trump administration to be taking away funds from cancer and Alzheimer's patients. \n\nStanding with the MA delegation to oppose these cuts until they are reversed.",
