                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "EMTALA is a federal law that requires emergency rooms to stabilize patients having medical crises.\n\nAccording to the Trump admin, if you\u2019re a woman dying of a pregnancy complication, you don\u2019t count - doctors shouldn\u2019t have to save your life. In fact, a state government can require that they let you die. \n\nThis is Trump\u2019s definition of \u201cprotecting women and girls.\"",
