                "text": "April is Arab American Heritage Month\u2014a time to honor the 3.7 million Arab Americans who\u2019ve shaped our country through science, service, and patriotism.\n\nFrom Nobel Prize-winning scientists and medical innovators to the brave, Arabic-speaking allies who served alongside U.S. troops, Arab Americans continue to shape our culture, economy, and national story.\n\nAmerica is smarter, stronger, and more vibrant because of them.",
